  </head><body><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td colspan="4" style="background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;padding:10px;border:1px solid #999">SwachERP — Industry Fit Analysis</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="background:#f0f4ff;font-style:italic;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc">Generated: 07 May 2026</td></tr><tr><th style="background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">TIER</th><th style="background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">INDUSTRY / SEGMENT</th><th style="background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">FIT %</th><th style="background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">DETAILS</th></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Manufacturing</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">95%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Production/BOM, Quality, Inventory, Gatepasses, Maintenance, Purchase, Accounting</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Trading / Distribution</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">93%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Invoicing, Multi-warehouse, Purchase, Sales Orders, CRM, GRN, GST</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Retail</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">91%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Dedicated POS module, Inventory, Invoicing, GST</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Education</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">90%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Full 12-tab Education ERP — Students, Fees, Attendance, Timetable, Library, Transport</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">IT / Software Services</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">88%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Projects, Timesheets, Expense Claims, CRM, Invoicing, HR & Payroll</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Excellent Fit (85–100%)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Professional Services (CA, Law, Consulting)</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">86%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Projects, Timesheets, Invoicing, TDS, Accounting, CRM</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Healthcare / Clinics</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">82%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Dedicated Healthcare module (OPD/IPD/Wards), HR, Accounting — missing pharmacy inventory</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Logistics / Transport</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">82%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Dedicated Logistics module, Fleet, Consignment Notes — missing GPS/live tracking</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Real Estate / Construction</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">80%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Dedicated RE module + Project Management, BOQ, Milestones — missing site attendance</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Agriculture / Agri-business</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">78%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Dedicated Agriculture module, Procurement, Commodity Prices — missing crop insurance</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">NGO / Non-profit</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">72%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Accounting, HR, Projects, Expense Claims — missing donor management</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Good Fit (65–84%)</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Pharma Distribution</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">70%</td><td style="background:#DBEAFE;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Inventory, Batch/Lot tracking, Purchase, GST — missing expiry-based stock alerts</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Partial Fit (40–64%)</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Restaurant / Food Service</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">45%</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Basic POS works — missing table management, KOT, recipe costing</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Partial Fit (40–64%)</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Hotel / Hospitality</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">35%</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">No room booking, housekeeping, or reservation system</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Partial Fit (40–64%)</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">E-commerce</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">50%</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Inventory + Invoicing work — no Shopify/WooCommerce sync, no returns portal</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Partial Fit (40–64%)</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Jewellery / Gold</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">20%</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">No gold rate management, karigar job work, hallmarking, or gold loan module</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Poor Fit (Under 40%)</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">NBFC / Microfinance / Nidhi</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">25%</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">No loan origination, EMI scheduler, KYC, RBI compliance reports</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Poor Fit (Under 40%)</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Insurance</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">20%</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">No policy management, claims, or agent commission tracking</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Poor Fit (Under 40%)</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Hospital (large / multi-specialty)</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">40%</td><td style="background:#FEE2E2;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Current healthcare is clinic-level — missing OT scheduling, LIMS, pharmacy</td></tr></table><br clear="all" style="mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td colspan="5" style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;padding:10px;border:1px solid #999">SwachERP — Gaps &amp; Missing Features</td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="background:#f0f4ff;font-style:italic;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc">Features not yet built that would increase industry fit — colour = priority (Red=High, Yellow=Medium, Green=Low)</td></tr><tr><th style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">INDUSTRY</th><th style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">CURRENT FIT %</th><th style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">WHAT'S MISSING</th><th style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">PRIORITY</th><th style="background:#B45309;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #999;font-weight:bold">EFFORT TO BUILD</th></tr><tr><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Manufacturing</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">95%</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">IoT machine integration, shop-floor app</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Low</td><td style="background:#D1FAE5;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Medium</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Trading / Distribution</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">93%</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">B2B customer portal, online order placement</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Medium</td><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top">Medium</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#FEF9C3;font-weight:normal;paddin